    <string name="src_espn">ESPN — no key needed.\nLive + upcoming (current window) + recent finished + match details. Polite 150ms between calls, no published quota.</string>
    <string name="src_fd">football-data.org — free key:\nhttps://www.football-data.org/client/register\nFree tier: 10 req/min. Full-season upcoming + finished + live (no minute) for 12 competitions (PL, PD, SA, BL1, FL1, DED, PPL, CL, EC, WC, ELC, BSA) + crests. No Süper Lig.</string>
    <string name="src_bz">sports.bzzoiro.com — token (register):\nhttps://sports.bzzoiro.com/\nPast + upcoming per team across 88 leagues (incl. Süper Lig), live with minute, no crests. Polite 400ms, no published quota.</string>
